 {
  "_doc": "Dynamic testing: the sequences no script promises. Garbage inputs, double-arming, arming the slot you hold, reload mid-hold, spam. Every answer must be a readable refusal or a clean recovery \u2014 never a page error (the harness fails on any)."
 },
